#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
IRAM OS Sovereign Theme Studio & Visual Switcher (Redesigned)
=============================================================
High-performance Wayland/Hyprland theme selector with:
- Asynchronous multi-threaded thumbnail loader with fast in-memory Cairo skeleton fallback
- Dynamic Self-Retheming Studio Engine (instant live CSS recoloring of the GUI itself)
- Spatial Glassmorphism UI (responsive 3-column grid fitted to 1040x720 window rule)
- Per-theme wallpaper memory and live desktop wallpaper cycling
- Animated Hyprland complementary dual-color border gradient live preview
- Seamless keyboard navigation (Arrows, Enter, Space, Tab, W, R, / for search, Esc)
"""

